WEBVTT

00:04.470 --> 00:06.850
<i><i>I worked as a salaryman 
for a toxic company,</i></i>

00:06.850 --> 00:08.960
<i><i>until I reincarnated...</i></i>

00:08.960 --> 00:13.630
<i><i>in a crazy world where everything is 
dropped by monsters in dungeons.</i></i>

00:13.630 --> 00:18.650
<i><i>In my new life, I'm level 1, 
but I have a unique skill</i></i>

00:18.650 --> 00:20.950
<i><i>that puts all of my drop rates at rank S.</i></i>

00:21.620 --> 00:24.270
<i><i>And now it's finally time 
for the harvest festival!</i></i>

00:24.270 --> 00:28.350
<i><i>But while that's going on, I get 
dragged into some major trouble!</i></i>

00:36.140 --> 00:45.270
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

02:00.010 --> 02:05.020
<b>Time for the Harvest Festival</b>

02:13.400 --> 02:15.560
Good morning, Yoda.

02:15.560 --> 02:17.150
Morning, Emily.

02:17.410 --> 02:19.570
Hey, where's everyone else?

02:19.570 --> 02:23.410
Celeste and Eve left for 
the dungeon this morning.

02:23.410 --> 02:27.900
Apparently, a massive amount of 
carrots has shown up in Telulu.

02:31.590 --> 02:33.560
That's gotta be wild...

02:34.000 --> 02:36.290
That just leaves Alice, and as I recall...

02:36.750 --> 02:40.170
Since Bonesy is so scared of Celeste,

02:40.170 --> 02:43.210
she's staying at her previous 
house today, right?

02:43.210 --> 02:44.650
That's right.

02:45.620 --> 02:48.620
You didn't go to the dungeon with them?

02:48.620 --> 02:51.480
No, since today is the harvest festival.

02:51.480 --> 02:53.920
I'm going to meet up with Alice around noon

02:53.920 --> 02:56.950
and show her around while 
we check out the festivities.

02:56.950 --> 03:00.780
Oh, the harvest festival. 
That's finally starting, huh?

03:00.780 --> 03:03.090
Would you like to come along with us?

03:19.220 --> 03:21.990
Yoda! Yoda! Look at all this!

03:21.990 --> 03:23.550
There are so many stalls!

03:23.780 --> 03:25.830
Yeah, it's pretty amazing.

03:25.830 --> 03:28.240
And over there, and over here...

03:26.510 --> 03:29.270
<i>Emily doesn't often get this 
excited over anything.</i>

03:29.810 --> 03:34.940
<i>Since she used to live in a dungeon, 
this festival stuff must be new to her.</i>

03:35.840 --> 03:38.750
Okay! Let's spend today...

03:38.750 --> 03:41.290
enjoying the heck out of this festival!

03:42.010 --> 03:43.250
Yes, let's!

03:49.790 --> 03:51.010
How cute!

03:51.280 --> 03:53.240
Which one do you like?

03:54.060 --> 03:55.160
Well, um...

03:55.590 --> 03:57.820
Maybe... this one?

03:58.080 --> 03:59.250
I'll take this one.

03:59.250 --> 04:01.550
You got it. That'll be 3,000 pilos.

04:01.550 --> 04:05.270
Y-Yoda! I wasn't trying to...

04:07.040 --> 04:08.510
Please take it.

04:09.520 --> 04:10.960
Thank you.

04:10.960 --> 04:13.300
Hey, good thinking!

04:14.550 --> 04:17.640
Now I can keep this bell 
with me all the time!

04:26.520 --> 04:29.700
Hey! Ryota! Emily!

04:29.700 --> 04:31.430
Ah, there you are.

04:34.170 --> 04:36.120
Guys, listen to this!

04:36.120 --> 04:38.540
There's this weird stall over there!

04:38.540 --> 04:40.130
A weird...

04:40.130 --> 04:41.640
...stall?

04:41.630 --> 04:45.510
Experience from Alkyl

04:41.640 --> 04:45.500
Low, low prices on experience 
points! Right over here!

04:45.500 --> 04:48.150
This is a weird stall, all right.

04:48.150 --> 04:49.170
Right?

04:49.170 --> 04:52.180
Hey, bro! How 'bout some experience points?

04:52.180 --> 04:53.520
How does this work?

04:53.520 --> 04:57.720
Well, have you ever been to 
the dungeon called Alkyl?

04:57.720 --> 04:59.180
No, I haven't.

04:59.180 --> 05:02.850
There's a monster there called a 
plated mouse, and it's amazing!

05:02.850 --> 05:06.780
When you defeat one, it gives 
you a ton of experience points!

05:06.780 --> 05:09.860
Oh, kinda like the metal slimes?

05:09.860 --> 05:12.180
If you leave one of these boxes out,

05:12.180 --> 05:15.000
a plated mouse stray will show up.

05:15.000 --> 05:18.930
And when you defeat that, 
you'll level up in a heartbeat!

05:19.580 --> 05:21.350
So how 'bout it?

05:21.560 --> 05:23.150
That sounds interesting.

05:23.150 --> 05:26.270
Ryota and I can't raise our 
levels any more, though.

05:27.210 --> 05:30.480
But we could use it to help Emily level up.

05:45.520 --> 05:48.230
Okay! Here comes the plated mouse!

05:51.250 --> 05:53.130
We'll start with a binding bullet!

05:55.410 --> 05:57.910
Way to go! Finish it, Emily!

05:57.910 --> 05:59.740
Not yet. First...

06:00.240 --> 06:01.830
Reservation!

06:02.190 --> 06:03.550
Now, Emily!

06:03.990 --> 06:05.470
Right!

06:13.600 --> 06:18.150
Huh? I thought strays didn't drop items.

06:18.530 --> 06:20.450
That's my Reservation spell.

06:20.450 --> 06:23.610
When I use it, my drop rates 
apply to the monster,

06:23.610 --> 06:25.910
even if it was Emily who killed it.

06:26.370 --> 06:29.450
So I level up, and I even get an item.

06:29.680 --> 06:30.940
That's great!

06:37.250 --> 06:38.470
Is this...

06:39.060 --> 06:41.580
<i>Ryota obtained a strengthening bullet.</i>

06:41.580 --> 06:45.340
Strengthening, huh? Let's test it out.

06:58.760 --> 06:59.630
Huh?

06:59.630 --> 07:01.870
Nothing's happening.

07:01.870 --> 07:04.300
It's not... broken, is it?

07:04.600 --> 07:07.090
Let me try a regular bullet.

07:07.620 --> 07:09.020
How about this?

07:13.630 --> 07:15.240
I was right!

07:15.240 --> 07:20.410
The strengthening bullet strengthens 
whatever bullet is loaded after it's shot!

07:20.410 --> 07:21.720
That's amazing!

07:21.720 --> 07:24.040
Yeah, this'll have lots of uses.

07:24.040 --> 07:26.560
We'd better go buy more from that stall!

07:26.560 --> 07:27.590
Yeah!

07:26.560 --> 07:27.590
Let's!

07:32.100 --> 07:34.670
Well, we've got lots of 
strengthening bullets now.

07:34.670 --> 07:36.110
What next?

07:37.670 --> 07:39.290
Do you think that was...

07:39.290 --> 07:40.270
Let's hurry!

07:40.270 --> 07:41.570
Right!

07:44.070 --> 07:46.400
A stray got out of its cage!

07:46.400 --> 07:47.250
Run!

07:47.250 --> 07:47.990
Hurry!

07:53.990 --> 07:55.400
Are you all right?

07:55.400 --> 07:56.400
Y-Yes...

07:56.400 --> 08:00.320
Everything's fine now. I beat the monster.

08:00.320 --> 08:01.570
Not yet, Ryota!

08:01.570 --> 08:03.750
You haven't beaten it yet!

08:03.750 --> 08:04.780
What?!

08:08.700 --> 08:10.140
Come on, this way!

08:10.140 --> 08:11.470
I'll finish it off!

08:22.400 --> 08:24.140
It didn't work!

08:24.140 --> 08:26.810
Something's weird about this thing.

08:27.430 --> 08:30.950
If it grows bigger by 
absorbing our attacks...

08:32.800 --> 08:34.620
You seem to be having some trouble.

08:35.780 --> 08:38.860
You're... Neptune!

08:39.290 --> 08:41.120
Hi there, Sato.

08:41.120 --> 08:44.510
Looks like you've made 
that thing pretty big.

08:46.570 --> 08:51.700
Yeah. We'll need to be smart about 
attacking it, or people could die.

08:51.700 --> 08:55.480
What are you gonna do? Turn tail and run?

08:55.480 --> 08:57.260
Don't be stupid!

08:57.260 --> 09:01.720
Help me out, Neptune! 
We've gotta protect our town!

09:02.930 --> 09:04.820
Lil! Ran!

09:04.820 --> 09:06.140
Understood.

09:06.140 --> 09:08.350
We'll do our best for you, Nep!

09:08.350 --> 09:09.950
God Bless!

09:08.350 --> 09:09.950
Devil Curse!

09:19.600 --> 09:21.110
Allow us to show you...

09:21.550 --> 09:24.350
the power of the Neptune Family!

09:27.570 --> 09:30.540
Okay! We'll all attack it at once!

09:30.540 --> 09:32.500
Neptune! Emily!

09:32.500 --> 09:33.390
Right!

09:33.390 --> 09:34.760
Ready when you are!

09:41.510 --> 09:42.740
Take this!

09:43.050 --> 09:44.390
Be still!

09:44.390 --> 09:46.500
Purgatorium Gravity!

09:58.970 --> 10:01.610
Thank you so much!

10:01.610 --> 10:05.100
My daughter and I got separated 
in the festival crowds.

10:05.500 --> 10:07.910
Try not to get lost again, okay?

10:07.910 --> 10:09.110
Okay.

10:09.110 --> 10:12.060
You need to thank them.

10:15.000 --> 10:17.070
Thank you, mister.

10:17.070 --> 10:18.770
I'm just glad you're safe.

10:19.110 --> 10:23.550
When I grow up, I'm gonna 
be an adventurer like you!

10:23.550 --> 10:27.840
Oh, yeah? In that case, 
I hope you'll remember this.

10:27.840 --> 10:29.520
Remember what?

10:30.060 --> 10:32.570
Hard work will always be rewarded.

10:34.120 --> 10:37.540
I got that from a very dear friend of mine.

10:38.590 --> 10:42.580
If you're gonna try to be an adventurer, 
too, let's work hard together.

10:43.080 --> 10:43.980
Yeah!

10:47.430 --> 10:48.820
Ryota!

10:49.590 --> 10:53.120
Celeste? Weren't you in the dungeon?

10:53.680 --> 10:55.930
I was just making a brief stop back here,

10:55.930 --> 11:00.130
and I heard you were all 
here fighting a monster.

11:00.130 --> 11:03.060
The magic cart's full of carrots!

11:03.060 --> 11:05.950
So you both came to help us?

11:05.950 --> 11:08.260
It looks like you're already done, though.

11:08.260 --> 11:11.750
Yeah, the Neptune Group helped us out.

11:12.240 --> 11:15.570
Defeating monsters is part of our job.

11:16.050 --> 11:19.140
Anyway, I see you've started a family, too.

11:19.370 --> 11:22.160
Yeah. They're all important 
members of the team.

11:23.670 --> 11:25.290
Hey, Sato...

11:25.290 --> 11:27.590
Don't you want to ditch this "family"

11:27.590 --> 11:30.440
and finally come over to my group?

11:30.980 --> 11:33.760
Ask me that all you want, 
but my answer's still no.

11:35.350 --> 11:37.950
What a shame. Shot down again.

11:38.400 --> 11:42.510
But I got to fight alongside you, 
so I'll be content with that for today.

11:42.900 --> 11:44.730
See you later, Sato.

11:48.890 --> 11:52.380
Well, in any case, I'm glad everyone's safe.

11:52.630 --> 11:55.520
Next time one shows up, I'll beat it!

11:55.400 --> 11:56.440
<b>Gurgle</b>

11:56.530 --> 11:59.570
Running in a panic like that made me hungry.

11:59.570 --> 12:03.490
Yes, and we've been in the 
dungeon all day, too.

12:03.490 --> 12:07.260
Well, then, since we're here, 
let's get food from the stalls around here.

12:07.260 --> 12:08.410
Yeah!

12:08.410 --> 12:10.320
Let's enjoy the festival to its fullest!

12:11.040 --> 12:12.540
This is pretty heavy, y'know...

12:11.040 --> 12:16.040
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

12:11.040 --> 12:16.040
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

12:12.540 --> 12:14.160
Keep it up, Nep!

12:13.490 --> 12:16.040
C'mon, Nep, tough it out!

12:14.160 --> 12:16.040
Help me out here...

12:17.130 --> 12:19.040
Oh, I'm gonna do something.

12:18.670 --> 12:21.050
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

12:18.670 --> 12:21.050
<b>My Unique Skill Makes <b>Me OP
Even at Level 1</b></b>

12:19.660 --> 12:21.040
See? There.

12:21.040 --> 12:24.730
Yoda, look at that! It looks like fun!

12:24.730 --> 12:26.180
Oh, cool!

12:30.080 --> 12:32.210
Low-Level, you suck at ring toss.

12:32.210 --> 12:33.060
Harsh!

12:35.480 --> 12:38.390
Bonesy, Jiggly, open wide.

12:39.440 --> 12:41.790
They look adorable when eating, too!

12:43.820 --> 12:45.130
Eve is...

12:45.130 --> 12:47.480
...eating something that isn't carrots!

12:47.480 --> 12:50.530
Rabbits are actually pretty 
okay with meat, too!

12:50.530 --> 12:54.410
You did tell us a story about that before.

12:54.410 --> 12:58.720
I saw a stall over there selling 
food made with carrots.

12:58.720 --> 13:02.490
I'm a gourmand. 
I only eat delicious carrots.

13:02.490 --> 13:06.400
Maybe you should eat a variety 
of foods and not be picky?

13:07.180 --> 13:09.670
A low-level shouldn't be so impudent!

13:09.670 --> 13:10.680
Ow!

13:11.770 --> 13:14.010
You two get along so well.

13:14.010 --> 13:15.440
<i>I honestly don't get her...</i>

13:20.070 --> 13:21.290
Hey, Ryota...

13:23.200 --> 13:26.590
It looks like there are a 
bunch of monsters over there.

13:26.590 --> 13:29.600
What? Did more strays show up?

13:29.600 --> 13:32.730
If they're in that direction, 
it's probably the arena.

13:32.730 --> 13:35.580
Arena? They have one of those?

13:35.580 --> 13:39.240
Yeah. Goods gathered 
for the harvest festival

13:39.240 --> 13:42.630
are turned into strays in 
the arena and then killed.

13:42.630 --> 13:45.040
Really? That's weird.

13:45.040 --> 13:48.040
Fighters participate in pairs.

13:48.040 --> 13:52.680
If you manage to defeat them, 
you can get a rare item as a prize.

13:52.680 --> 13:56.200
A rare item! I wanna try for one!

13:56.200 --> 13:58.110
Why don't we join, then?

13:58.370 --> 14:00.420
Who will be on your team?

14:00.420 --> 14:05.440
Assuming you participate, 
you'll need one more with you.

14:10.230 --> 14:12.400
Celeste, can I ask you?

14:12.400 --> 14:14.260
What?! Me?!

14:14.260 --> 14:16.860
Are you that surprised?

14:16.860 --> 14:20.700
I thought you would be the 
best choice for this.

14:20.700 --> 14:24.640
I-Is that... like... a confession?

14:24.900 --> 14:28.060
You're always out there 
getting intel for me,

14:28.060 --> 14:29.940
and you know a lot about monsters.

14:29.940 --> 14:33.110
So you're the best bet 
for something like this!

14:36.200 --> 14:37.400
What's wrong?

14:37.840 --> 14:41.560
That makes me happy, but it feels 
like you don't see me as one of you.

14:41.560 --> 14:43.480
Is there some kind of problem?

14:43.480 --> 14:44.860
No problem at all!

15:05.160 --> 15:07.800
Die! Inferno!

15:09.700 --> 15:15.020
C-Celeste? You seem to be 
going harder than usual...

15:15.440 --> 15:16.770
You're imagining things!

15:16.770 --> 15:19.820
Anyway, that thing's still alive, you know!

15:21.360 --> 15:22.470
I know!

15:28.060 --> 15:31.870
It takes two to defeat a high guts slime.

15:32.350 --> 15:35.840
You've mastered the art of leaving 
them with just enough HP.

15:35.840 --> 15:37.450
You rock, Celeste!

15:37.450 --> 15:38.770
Ryota...

15:39.220 --> 15:42.130
I'm going to work even harder.

15:42.130 --> 15:46.260
I want to be as important a 
teammate to you as Emily is.

15:46.260 --> 15:49.380
You already are, Celeste. You know that.

15:50.540 --> 15:52.500
Ryota, you jerk!

15:52.500 --> 15:55.590
You're gonna make me happy, 
saying things like that!

15:58.520 --> 16:00.960
The harvest festival sure was fun.

16:00.960 --> 16:02.470
It was amazing!

16:02.740 --> 16:07.990
Hey, Celeste, what was the 
rare item we got at the arena?

16:07.990 --> 16:09.150
It's in here.

16:09.540 --> 16:11.410
It's a... let's see...

16:11.830 --> 16:13.450
What in the world is this?

16:13.450 --> 16:18.370
<b>Let's all play together</b>

16:13.450 --> 16:18.370
Fun

16:13.450 --> 16:18.370
<b>Fireworks</b>

16:13.450 --> 16:18.370
<b>Set</b>

16:14.010 --> 16:17.850
It looks like it has lots of 
the same thing inside it.

16:18.580 --> 16:20.360
I've never seen that before.

16:20.360 --> 16:22.030
Those are fireworks.

16:25.920 --> 16:29.870
Wow! This is amazing, Yoda! Just amazing!

16:30.250 --> 16:33.790
I never thought I'd get to play 
with fireworks in this world.

16:33.790 --> 16:36.050
Long live rare items!

16:36.050 --> 16:37.530
Not bad.

16:37.980 --> 16:39.390
They're so pretty.

16:46.870 --> 16:49.060
That was fun!

16:49.060 --> 16:52.230
Right? I hadn't played with 
fireworks since I was a kid.

16:52.230 --> 16:54.140
I'm glad I got to do this with all of you.

16:54.140 --> 16:57.390
This was my first time doing 
anything like a festival,

16:57.390 --> 16:59.210
so I'm just really happy...

17:02.650 --> 17:03.550
Alice?

17:04.760 --> 17:05.940
They're calling...

17:06.310 --> 17:07.860
Hey! Alice?!

17:09.050 --> 17:10.870
A new little one?

17:12.740 --> 17:15.130
Alice! Are you okay?

17:17.560 --> 17:18.560
Ryota...

17:19.000 --> 17:20.870
Yeah, I'm okay.

17:21.420 --> 17:24.110
Alice! Did something happen?

17:24.680 --> 17:28.230
I had a feeling someone was calling for me.

17:28.230 --> 17:30.640
Which direction did it come from?

17:31.710 --> 17:32.880
That way.

17:32.880 --> 17:35.160
That's where Nihonium is.

17:35.160 --> 17:38.500
Is there another monster in 
there that you can befriend?

17:38.500 --> 17:41.190
Maybe? I'm not really sure.

17:41.520 --> 17:45.290
I want you to befriend a monster 
that gives infinite carrots!

17:45.290 --> 17:48.380
Or you could just get a carrot as a friend!

17:48.620 --> 17:52.660
I'd feel bad for a carrot friend 
that you're just going to eat.

17:52.940 --> 17:56.550
We can go check it out 
tomorrow. It's late now.

17:57.260 --> 17:59.870
You should stay with us tonight, Alice.

18:00.480 --> 18:01.300
Can I?

18:01.300 --> 18:01.970
Can she?!

18:04.260 --> 18:08.220
Celeste, try not to scare 
Bonesy and Jiggly too much.

18:09.640 --> 18:11.160
I'll be careful...

18:16.890 --> 18:20.070
Ah, I'm glad you came, Sato.

18:20.070 --> 18:23.540
I heard you wanted to talk to me.

18:23.540 --> 18:25.250
What's going on?

18:25.250 --> 18:28.860
Come, have a seat. I'll put some coffee on.

18:28.860 --> 18:31.160
How many dozens of 
sugar cubes would you like?

18:31.400 --> 18:33.320
Just one cube is fine.

18:33.610 --> 18:36.150
Ever the conservative type, aren't you?

18:36.820 --> 18:42.180
The thing is, nothing's been dropping 
in the dungeons since last night.

18:42.480 --> 18:43.360
Huh?

18:43.360 --> 18:49.170
Telulu, Silicon, Arsenic, 
Bismuth, Polon, and Selen.

18:49.170 --> 18:55.110
All six of Secro's dungeons 
have ceased to produce drops.

18:55.450 --> 18:57.310
A-All of them?!

18:57.590 --> 18:59.800
This has never happened before.

18:59.800 --> 19:01.710
As ashamed as I am to admit it,

19:01.710 --> 19:06.240
I don't even know how long this will last.

19:06.590 --> 19:08.410
Please, Sato!

19:08.410 --> 19:13.470
Would you investigate what's going on here?

19:13.470 --> 19:15.410
Investigate how?

19:15.730 --> 19:18.900
I realize I'm asking too much of you,

19:18.900 --> 19:21.750
but you're the only one I can rely on!

19:21.750 --> 19:25.990
You're the one who got all 
those rare drops from Selen!

19:26.350 --> 19:26.960
Right?

19:29.320 --> 19:33.260
All right. I can't just ignore this.

19:33.260 --> 19:34.630
I'll do what I...

19:34.630 --> 19:37.870
No, I'll do everything in my power 
to find out why this is happening.

19:40.700 --> 19:42.820
<b>Telulu Level 2</b>

19:44.630 --> 19:47.830
It's no use. No items are dropping.

19:47.830 --> 19:49.740
Just like on the other floors.

19:50.040 --> 19:51.700
The carrots have died.

19:52.220 --> 19:54.680
Carrot is dead.

19:54.680 --> 19:57.680
Why isn't anything dropping, damn it?!

19:58.040 --> 20:01.630
I can't pay off my mortgage 
if I can't earn money here!

20:01.630 --> 20:04.550
Yeah, but what are we 
supposed to do about it?

20:04.550 --> 20:06.790
I've got debt, too, y'know!

20:06.790 --> 20:10.340
Oh, boy... What do I tell 
my family waiting at home?

20:10.340 --> 20:11.250
Damn it!

20:11.650 --> 20:14.520
There might be something 
dropping something somewhere.

20:15.060 --> 20:16.710
Let's search every nook and cranny!

20:18.240 --> 20:19.840
This looks bad.

20:19.840 --> 20:24.330
Prices are already rising,
 and people are buying up all they can.

20:24.330 --> 20:26.960
It'll be terrible if we 
can't buy vegetables.

20:27.370 --> 20:29.970
Low-level! Make a carrot come out!

20:29.970 --> 20:32.140
That's easy for you to say...

20:32.140 --> 20:33.240
Hurry up!

20:33.240 --> 20:35.900
I'm telling you, it's not gonna happen.

20:39.900 --> 20:40.880
Huh?!

20:43.140 --> 20:44.970
Yay! Resurrected carrot!

20:44.970 --> 20:50.430
But how? Nothing is 
dropping for anyone else.

20:51.160 --> 20:53.470
Is it just me?

20:53.930 --> 20:56.930
I had a feeling someone was calling for me.

20:57.130 --> 21:02.260
It's apparently a useless dungeon 
where nothing drops at all.

21:02.260 --> 21:04.580
Nothing drops at all?

21:05.660 --> 21:06.910
That's it!

21:07.300 --> 21:08.760
Yoda?

21:08.760 --> 21:10.190
I'll be right back!

21:14.370 --> 21:17.960
<b>Nihonium Level 1</b>

21:18.740 --> 21:22.160
<i>If all the dungeons are like Nihonium now...</i>

21:23.410 --> 21:27.970
<i>and if I'm right about the presence 
Alice was picking up on...</i>

21:25.590 --> 21:29.970
<b>Nihonium Level 4</b>

21:38.640 --> 21:39.970
I found you!

21:40.560 --> 21:43.830
You're the reason nothing's dropping 
in the dungeons, aren't you?!

21:44.730 --> 21:47.090
You're Nihonium's dungeon master!

21:51.780 --> 21:52.830
<i>What?!</i>

21:59.090 --> 22:00.850
Don't tell me...

22:01.540 --> 22:04.900
None of my attacks work on it?!
